Fuploadstatic.mihoyo.com%2Fbh3-wiki%2F2022%2F01%2F17%2F6100274%2F5724d3b7e32ac9b1fc331cdf0932baf2_5101874479743181000.png%22%2C%22num%22%3A1%7D%5D%2C%22otherMaterial%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%88%B1%E5%9B%A0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%8E%AF%E7%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%22%2C%22num%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22num%22%3A50%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22num%22%3A4%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1667835361913\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/17/6100274/2a234b1df6bcffec694ea582752af359_7053236991543255263.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">436</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">23</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">人生即为二律背反的矛盾螺旋。每个人都在负重前行，于世界上留下属于自己的路。而生为战士的意义，或许就是在前人之路的尽头一一用自己的意志去继续他们的拓荒之旅。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「人就是一条终将汇入大海的河流。河流越是流向大海就会越浑浊一一但也只有大海，能够容纳浑浊的河流而仍然保有自我。」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">唯有不断超越自己，人生才不会诸般因果所带来的矛盾所埋葬。唯有不断超越自己，人类才会拥有明天之后的幸福。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">汲暗致光</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:25秒]发动一次突刺攻击，造成50%攻击力物理伤害。如果击中非无敌/霸体状态的敌人，则发动投技攻击，控制敌人并造成共90%+1400.0%攻击力物理伤害；在敌人特定招式期间，武器按钮闪光时，可无视所有条件发动反击投技，控制敌人并造成20%+800.0%攻击力物理伤害，不计入冷却时间</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">天元骑英装备时，骑士形态下武器技为投技攻击，卫士形态武器技为【炮击】：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">点击武器技可释放炮击，连续释放三次后会进行装填</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">第一击：造成300%攻击力物理伤害</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">第二击：造成300%攻击力物理伤害</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">第三击：造成300%攻击力物理伤害</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">特殊攻击后点击武器技释放威力巨大的【连携炮击】：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【普攻第四击连携炮击】：造成共计400%攻击力物理伤害</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【天元霸斩连携炮击】：造成共计3*400.0%攻击力物理伤害</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">因果轮回</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色暴击率提高15.0%，武器技能造成的全伤害提30.0%，物理伤害提高15.0%</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">天元破晓</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色造成全伤害提高20.0%，触发极限闪避技能后，角色后方所受到的伤害降低35.0%，持续12.0秒，重复触发刷新持续时间</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" 