\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/24/50494840/ec6194dec904461b1ad0df332071bed9_8643279489736354311.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">物理输出向超限骑枪武器，被动提高物伤、全伤、暴击率和武器技全伤，其他角色使用时提供了不错的属性与面板；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">天元骑英使用时，通过【炮击】补充输出的同时，快速回复超变能量，提升循环能力，拓展攻击模式。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/24/50494840/ec6194dec904461b1ad0df332071bed9_8643279489736354311.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
